{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:2.40.060","page_type":"section"},"citation":"2.40.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","content_hash":"fef722ddf47b84e7829637927c7369400194c18b7e1a4dbe7a3ccd0210128293","heading":"Municipal Judge – Appointment – Qualifications – Compensation.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","text":"The Municipal Court shall be presided over by a Municipal Judge. The judge shall be selected in the manner provided by City ordinance. The person who is selected shall be:\n(a) A citizen of the United States;\n(b) A graduate of a high school or secondary school or the equivalent thereof; and\n(c) An attorney regularly admitted to practice law in the State of Kansas.\nThe Municipal Judge shall receive a monthly or annual salary set in accordance with City rules and regulations and the City pay plan. (Ord. 20206 § 9, 9-10-19; Ord. 17666 § 5, 3-27-01. Code 1995 § 50-40. Formerly 2.110.060.)\nState Law References: Similar State statute, K.S.A. 12-4105 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"9d776d34-8331-536b-9460-367d19294c7d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","content_hash":"e168951954f835ea1926e9d15982eff4a6f0cd6f4502ed17a0cfa051248b498e","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","text":"The Municipal Court shall be presided over by a Municipal Judge. The judge shall be selected in the manner provided by City ordinance. The person who is selected shall be:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"615b20aa-aa0c-529d-8156-cec7ed5a1de8"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","content_hash":"3f548220d72ff36806ba7861620026e08cd16068fbdb17aaf6b8e01a55f4595a","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","text":"(a) A citizen of the United States;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"5fb1ac3c-a281-5edc-ab1d-1f193379b2b4"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","content_hash":"025b83e8beac0e8cdf15c2cfa22dd67f884f03ad53aecb3f05a380525665e8ef","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","text":"(b) A graduate of a high school or secondary school or the equivalent thereof; and","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"3f888261-7858-52e9-a091-461eb9e84673"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","content_hash":"d8c05fb6d5cebf26766184d6ad9727b32e78a7db7d3c6895ed392735c1a655c6","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","text":"(c) An attorney regularly admitted to practice law in the State of Kansas.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"aad8623b-ed39-517d-9604-b9f4770e6d46"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","content_hash":"8e0c2267d90adb749c8a42de86f9395eaab81ecfe3ef4f11a12a70492ea8532e","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","text":"The Municipal Judge shall receive a monthly or annual salary set in accordance with City rules and regulations and the City pay plan. (Ord. 20206 § 9, 9-10-19; Ord. 17666 § 5, 3-27-01. Code 1995 § 50-40. Formerly 2.110.060.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"29ececa6-7cf6-5ed7-a6a1-26802393166d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","content_hash":"2f7752ad57f1f3f525269ccfb1bd1a318084abf17ae38d5edba9138d22a62aec","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.060","text":"State Law References: Similar State statute, K.S.A. 12-4105 .","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"f620dbb4-e74b-56d1-881c-3b7a88ef1ff0"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.060:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}